[TITLE]
InpWriter round-trip fixture: IRREGULAR cross-sections referencing [TRANSECTS]
The [XSECTIONS] writer had STREET and CUSTOM branches but none for IRREGULAR, so
the transect NAME was replaced by derived y_full/w_max numerics on save. On
reload the numeric parsed as an (undefined) transect name, the reference failed
to resolve silently, and the conduit degenerated to zero area. TRAP_MAIN
exercises the full X1 tail (banks, Lfactor, Xfactor, Yfactor as an elevation
offset) and 7 GR pairs so the writer emits more than one GR line; CREEK_A
carries a 6-decimal station to pin full-precision GR emission; C2 has 2 barrels
to pin the barrels column surviving in position 7.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
END_DATE             01/02/2020
END_TIME             00:00:00
REPORT_STEP          00:15:00
WET_STEP             00:05:00
DRY_STEP             01:00:00
ROUTING_STEP         0:00:30
MIN_SLOPE            0

[EVAPORATION]
CONSTANT   0.0
DRY_ONLY   NO

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name  Elev  MaxDepth  InitDepth  SurDepth  Aponded
J1       10.0  8.0       0          0         0
J2       9.0   8.0       0          0         0

[OUTFALLS]
;;Name  Elev  Type  StageData  Gated
O1       8.0   FREE  *          NO

[CONDUITS]
;;Name  FromNode  ToNode  Length  Roughness  InOffset  OutOffset
C1       J1        J2      400.0   0.013      0         0
C2       J2        O1      400.0   0.013      0         0

[XSECTIONS]
;;Link  Shape      Geom1      Geom2  Geom3  Geom4  Barrels
C1       IRREGULAR  TRAP_MAIN
C2       IRREGULAR  CREEK_A    0      0      0      2

[TRANSECTS]
NC 0.015    0.015    0.030
X1 TRAP_MAIN 7        20.0     80.0     0        0        1.5      2.0      0.5
GR 10.0     0        8.0      20.0     6.0      40.0     5.5      50.0     6.0      60.0
GR 8.0      80.0     10.0     100.0
NC 0.020    0.020    0.035
X1 CREEK_A   6        10.0     30.0     0        0        0        0        0
GR 5.0      0        3.0      10.0     2.0      12.123456 2.0     20.0     3.5      30.0
GR 5.0      40.0

[REPORT]
INPUT       NO
CONTROLS    NO
NODES       ALL
LINKS       ALL

[COORDINATES]
;;Node  X-Coord  Y-Coord
J1       0.0      0.0
J2       500.0    0.0
O1       1000.0   0.0
